Local adaptation of pi-subagents 0.90.0 (gitHead f8248a7d0851df3dec8313764bd0be89d261003d).
Preserve the runner configuration's workflow parent/key in bootstrap status,
matching subagent-runner.js before the detached runner publishes its first update.
The package runs this launch code from two copies: the parent Pi loads the
bundle, while child Pi processes and the detached runner load src.

